<tr><td bgcolor=#000099><font color=#ffaaaa><b>■[1761] みのちょるを励ますスレ</b>
<div align=right><a href="bbs.cgi?action=resview&resno=1761">
<img src="icondata/res.gif" border=0></a></div></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#000000>&nbsp;&nbsp;ち（ｒｙ 
</td></tr><tr><td align=right><table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=1 width=95%><tr><td align=center>
<img src="icondata/blank.gif" width=32 height=32 border=0>
</td><td width=90%><font color=#000000>ゆっくり療養するべし(´Д`)</font><div align=right><small>
<br><font color=#990000> </font>
<br><font color=#000099> 6/25(Fri) 22:27</font><font color=#000000>
 &nbsp;&nbsp;[<a href="bbs.cgi?action=edit&lno=1761&rno=0"><font color=#000099>編集</font></a>]
[<a href="bbs.cgi?action=delete&lno=1761&rno=0
