<div align=right><table border=0 width=90%><tr><td colspan=2 bgcolor=#000000>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;く（ｒｙ</td></tr><tr><td align=center><img src="icondata/druid.gif" border=0>
</td><td width=90%><font color=#000000>大変だってねえ、痔の治療</font>
<div align=right><small>
<br><font color=#990000> </font>
<br><font color=#000099> 6/25(Fri) 22:56</font><font color=#000000><small>
 &nbsp;&nbsp;[<a href="bbs.cgi?action=edit&lno=1761&rno=1"><font color=#000099>編集</font></a>]
[<a href="bbs.cgi?action=delete&lno=1761&rno=1
