<table cellpadding=1 cellspacing=2 bordercolor=#000099 bgcolor=#dcdcff border=2 width=80%>
<tr><td bgcolor=#000099><font color=#ffaaaa><b>■[1760] Bye Friends</b>
<div align=right><a href="bbs.cgi?action=resview&resno=1760">
<img src="icondata/res.gif" border=0></a></div></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#000000>&nbsp;&nbsp;Gosok 
</td></tr><tr><td align=right><table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=1 width=95%><tr><td align=center>
<img src="icondata/blank.gif" width=32 height=32 border=0>
</td><td width=90%><font color=#000000>Hello Blade Members,<br><br>I cannot logon to EQ anymore, and I know there are fewer and fewer people playing EQ now.  I'd like to say goodbye to all the friends I know from Blade before everyone stop checking this BBS.  Even though, we may not see each other again in the future, but I will always remember your names.  The only one thing I have earned playing EQ is getting to know people from different culture, Korean/Chinese members from Aasadal, Japanese members from Blade.  This is something I cannot gain from anywhere else, and I really cherish the time we spent together, working together for a common goal, kill that named, clear the dungeon, etc.  I was most impressed by Blade members who can control 3-box at the same time during very tough raid.  I can hardly handle myself, and you guy can do 3, or more.. that's amazing.  <br><br>It's really sad to say goodbye, to finally admit it is over now.  I hope you well in your future adventure.<br><br>Gosok<br><br>BTW, I hope some Blade members can send me Real Life picture of yourselves.  If you want, please send to tpgosok@hotmail.com<br><br>Thanks.</font><div align=right><small>
<br><font color=#990000> </font>
<br><font color=#000099> 6/25(Fri) 13:40</font><font color=#000000>
 &nbsp;&nbsp;[<a href="bbs.cgi?action=edit&lno=1760&rno=0"><font color=#000099>編集</font></a>]
[<a href="bbs.cgi?action=delete&lno=1760&rno=0
"><font color=#000099>削除</font></a>]</font></small>
</div></td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
<br><br>
