</td><td width=90%><font color=#000000>Actually, AB members poping not enough for raids. <br>I know this reason is every members has RL work and RL problem.. <br>so cant make everyday pop.. <br>So, I offer 'How about make raid day and time?' and pick day, time after reset raid day and time. <br>I think it is better than nothing to do now. <br>I told this to Futur, Yuta, Koyuki, and Aasadal officers asking this to members. <br>Think about our raids.. We was very close to EP... <br>We have enough power and tactics to enter the EP. <br>only problem is just few members poping, so cant do more raids now.. <br>We was just do Seru and BoT Tower in 2 weeks. <br>just problem was 'NOT' enough members for raid.<br>Please post yer think. <br>If u can easy pop Tues day 8pm.. then post 'Tues day, 8pm' and yer think. <br><br>EX) Lusny's best raid day and time is SAT, MON and 8pm after....and good raid day is.. <br>Tues, Friday, Monday.. and 9pm after..then post.. <br><br>Best : Mon, Saturday 8pm(KST) <br>Good : Mon, Tues, Friday 9pm(KST) <br></font><div align=right><small>
